        1
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.in.gov/history/state-historical-markers/find-a-marker/find-historical-markers-by-county/indiana-historical-markers-by-county/henry-c.-ulen,-1871-1963/",
      "category": "people",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Ulen sits within Center Township and is surrounded by the larger city of Lebanon, a key landmark for locals.",
